le table. That","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is what makes ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fallback:"},{"text":" expressible at all — a per-row rule cannot","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"know that no later row matched.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Saying it once","anchor":"Saying-it-once"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A row with no ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"again:"},{"text":" — neither its own nor the table’s — repeats","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"forever and records nothing, exactly as before this parameter existed.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A game that never writes ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"again:"},{"text":" produces byte-identical saves.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The table’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"again:"},{"text":" retires ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reply:"},{"type":"text","text":" rows only"}]},{"text":". A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"perform:"},{"text":" row","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"opts in by naming a line of its own, because its body can move the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"world and adding a default to a table must never change what the world","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"does"}]},{"text":", only what is ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"said"}]},{"text":". A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"perform:"},{"text":" row that does name one runs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its body once; the repeat is the line alone.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A row that has been heard still ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineConte